  "title": "Harbour",
  "description": "Brief: a busy old harbour. A stone quay with bollards and lamp posts along the water, a row of tall narrow harbour houses in bright colours with gables, two brick warehouses with loading doors and hoist beams, fish stalls, crates, barrels and a harbour crane; a second row of houses across a cobbled street and gardens with trees behind. In the harbour: a tall ship moored along the quay, fishing boats and rowing boats by a wooden jetty with steps down to the water, and a breakwater running out to a red-and-white lighthouse with a gallery and a lantern.",
